        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>AHI MONACO, Monaco Leverset with Square Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Monaco Lever in Satin Brass is a stunning, sleek leverset that features a gold finish and a modern square rose. The Monaco Leverset with Square Rose will fit most pre-drilled doors that are 1-1/4 inches to 1-3/4 inches thick with either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Modern Monaco Satin Brass Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Solid metal lever and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Monaco Leverset with Square Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Zinc</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Satin Brass</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4.98\" (126.4mm)</li>\r\n<li>Lever Width: 0.55\" (13.9mm)</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection: 2.06\" (52.4mm)</li>\r\n<li>Rose Length: 2.36\" (59.9mm) square</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 0.39\" (10mm)</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Handing: non-handed</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/AHI-Monaco-Specifications.pdf?v=1691093348\"><b>AHI Monaco Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door lever on one side of the door. Visible surface mounting screws. Package Includes: 1 lever, 1 rose, and mounting screws.</li></li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door levers on both sides of the door. Visible surface mounting screws on interior and exterior. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Visible mounting screws on interior. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Privacy pin on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Visible mounting screws on interior. Package Includes: 2 levers, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
